[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012864519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121#issuecomment-4012864519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117121","id":4012864519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vL3QH","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T16:52:43Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T16:52:43Z","body":"What kind of testing do you need in real projects? That the two added conditions don't cause more friction on average than this optimization, I assume?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012864519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4028810990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121#issuecomment-4028810990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117121","id":4028810990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wIsbu","user":{"login":"Shadows-of-Fire","id":3682588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODI1ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3682588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire","html_url":"https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T05:33:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T05:33:05Z","body":"Yeah I don't think you need to justify it too strongly in a real project sense. It would be very difficult to determine what the real-world impact of reducing the stack usage for function calls that do not invoke `self` are. The 10% improvement in a synthetic benchmark is good enough, IMO.\r\n\r\nWe can say with a high degree of certainty that the runtime would be better with this optimization than without it.\r\n\r\nLooking at the vm here has me wondering what the purpose of `ADDR_STACK_NIL` is and why each stack needs it's own null...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4028810990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063025712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121#issuecomment-4063025712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117121","id":4063025712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yLNow","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T13:47:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T13:47:26Z","body":"> That the two added conditions don't cause more friction on average than this optimization, I assume?\r\n\r\nI'm not exactly worried about runtime overhead. But this optimization introduces the possibility of hard to debug compiler bugs. If for some reason we don't setup the stack correctly it might be hard to track down the issue.\r\n\r\nSo I'm more like searching for real improvements that make it worth introducing this regression surface.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063025712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,